commit 0f7d1e536bed9f01dd7161f7637af19bb0908335.
The original BSD 3-Clause terms are retained in LICENSE-HEADSCALE-GO.

Typed policy approval vectors and per-node policy persistence ordering follow
hscontrol/policy/policy.go and state/state.go (autoApproveNodes) at the same pin.

CachedNodeSnapshot and SQLite/Postgres selected-column updates in
src/headscale_nodes.rs follow hscontrol/state/state.go (persistNode and
nodeUpdateColumns) at the same v0.29.5 pin.

Policy history INSERT RETURNING and timestamp projection in src/policies.rs
follow hscontrol/db/policy.go and hscontrol/types/policy.go (gorm.Model) at
the same pinned v0.29.5 source.

Native expiry-only UPDATE and its automatic clock follow NodeSetExpiry in
hscontrol/db/node.go at the same pinned v0.29.5 source.

Cached-ID DELETE success for zero affected rows follows hscontrol/db/node.go
DeleteNode at the same v0.29.5 pin.

headscale_nodes/cached_registration.rs and cached auth-key transaction entry
points follow state/state.go applyAuthNodeUpdate/RegisterNodeWithPreAuthKey
selected-column and credential-consumption behavior at the same v0.29.5 pin.

headscale_nodes/new_registration.rs and fresh auth-key transaction entry points
follow state/state.go createAndSaveNewNode's original node fields and atomic
credential consumption before NodeStore publication at the same v0.29.5 pin.

The empty preauth-key display fallback follows hscontrol/types/preauth_key.go
PreAuthKey.Proto at the same v0.29.5 pin.

Direct native preauth list/mint projection, numeric-owner binding, original
insert timestamps, fractional expiry, scoped deletion and distinct node/key
zero-time expiry rules follow hscontrol/grpcv1.go, db/preauth_keys.go,
types/preauth_key.go and types/node.go at the same v0.29.5 pin.

Preauth user/key transaction capture, batched user preload, SQLite immediate
read/write transactions and context-independent handler completion follow
hscontrol/db/db.go, db/sqliteconfig/config.go, db/preauth_keys.go and grpcv1.go
at the same v0.29.5 pin.

Credential user preload before bcrypt, first-ID lookup, captured native
validation/planning and existing-node selection ordering follow
hscontrol/db/preauth_keys.go, types/preauth_key.go and state/state.go
at the same v0.29.5 pin.
